  "prefLabel": "Env-Wq 903.01 License Required",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 903.01 License Required.\n\n(a) As specified in RSA 485-A:24:\n\n(1) No person shall for profit or for charitable purposes operate any youth recreation camp (YRC) without a license issued by the department; and\n\n(2) The license to operate a year-round camp required by RSA 485-A:24 shall be good only for the calendar year in which it is issued.\n\n(b) The license to operate a seasonal camp required by RSA 485-A:24, I, shall be good only between the opening and closing dates noted on the application.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 and Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Env-Wq 900) #12364, eff 9-1-17",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-wq900.html"
}
